# scripts/

Bash utility scripts for the ${PROJECT_NAME} mobile app. Linux/macOS targets
plus Git Bash on Windows.

| Script | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| [`check-file-size.sh`](check-file-size.sh) | Warns on `.ts`/`.tsx` files exceeding 500 lines. Wired into `npm run lint`. Warning-only. |

## Conventions

- All scripts start with `set -euo pipefail` (or `set -uo pipefail` when
  exit-0 behaviour matters for warnings).
- Functions use `snake_case` with a module prefix.
- Log markers: `[INFO]`, `[OK]`, `[WARN]`, `[FAIL]`.
